        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>SpanEmitter</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::modules::SpanEmitter</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Injectable span emitter callback. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Callers receive span events via the <computeroutput>operator()</computeroutput> overload. The default type alias accepts <computeroutput>std::function&lt;void(const SpanEvent&amp;)&gt;</computeroutput> so any lambda, function pointer, or callable can be used.</para>
<para>Thread safety: implementations shared across threads must be internally synchronized. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
